==Russian==

===Alternative forms===
* {{alt|ru|со-||before certain consonant clusters; also a separate prefix meaning "co-"}}

===Etymology===
{{inh+|ru|sla-pro|*sъ-|*sъ(n)-}}, from {{inh|ru|ine-pro|*ḱom}}. See {{cog|sla-pro|*sъ(n)}} for more information. The {{IPAchar|/n/}} persists in {{m|ru|снять}} (originally a prefixed derivative of {{m|ru|ять||to [[take]]}}), from which other words in {{m|ru|-нять}} were produced by {{glossary|rebracketing}}. See also {{m|ru|с}}, {{cog|orv|съ}}, and compare the analogous loss of ''-n-'' in {{m|ru|в-}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ru-IPA|с-}} {{q|before vowels and all consonants except those noted below}}
* {{ru-IPA|з-}} {{q|before voiced obstruents except for {{lang|ru|в}} and {{lang|ru|ж}}}}
* {{ru-IPA|ж-}} {{q|before {{lang|ru|ж}}, where it forms a long consonant {{IPAchar|/ʐː/}}, as in {{m|ru|сжечь}}}}
* {{ru-IPA|ш-}} {{q|before {{lang|ru|ш}}, where it forms a long consonant {{IPAchar|/ʂː/}}, as in {{m|ru|сшить}}}}
* {{ru-IPA|ɕ-}} {{q|before {{lang|ru|ч}} and {{lang|ru|щ}}, where it forms a long consonant {{IPAchar|/ɕː/}}, as in {{m|ru|счита́ть}}}}

===Prefix===
{{head|ru|prefix|cat2=verbal prefixes}}

# {{lb|ru|with verbs}} {{gloss|describing an action moving from a single position or many positions into another single position}}
#: {{prefex|ru|лить|g1=impf|t1=to pour|слить|g2=pf|t2=to pour into one place}}
# {{lb|ru|with verbs}} [[down]] {{gloss|describing a downward action}}
#: {{prefex|ru|ходи́ть|t1=to go|сходи́ть|t2=to go down}}
# {{lb|ru|with verbs}} [[off]], from [[off]] {{gloss|describing an action of removing oneself to another location}}
# {{n-g|added to nouns, forms adverbs with the approximate meaning "from the location of [the noun]"}}
#: {{prefex|ru|верх|t1=the top|све́рху|t2=from above}}

